{"id":"99ff69edbf76f2a7","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-los-quotient-form.md","title":"Łoś Theorem in Quotient Notation","display":"thm-los-quotient-form — Łoś Theorem in Quotient Notation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-los-quotient-form","aliases":["17-thm-los-quotient-form"],"display":"thm-los-quotient-form — Łoś Theorem in Quotient Notation","depends_on":["[[17-thm-los]]","[[17-df-ultraproduct-notation]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; derived by checked notation substitution","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"Theorem 4.1.9(ii), quotient-notation variant","source_pages_print":[217,218,219],"source_pages_djvu":[233,234,235],"legacy_label":"17-thm-4.3.2b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-los-quotient-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-los-quotient-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-los-quotient-form — Łoś Theorem in Quotient Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e71f70cb66ea186\" href=\"?note=3e71f70cb66ea186\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct-notation\">17-df-ultraproduct-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; derived by checked notation substitution"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 4.1.9(ii), quotient-notation variant"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span><span>219</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>233</span><span>234</span><span>235</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-4.3.2b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a> 所列 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的超滤子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_U\">\\([f]_U\\)</span> 取其超积构造的乘积与商类；商结构记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e71f70cb66ea186\" href=\"?note=3e71f70cb66ea186\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct-notation\">17-df-ultraproduct-notation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 与元组满足分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\;\n\\left(\n\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\\models\\varphi[([\\bar f(j)]_U)_{j&lt;n}]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi[(\\bar f(j)(i))_{j&lt;n}]\\}\\in U\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar f\\in P^n\\;\n\\left(\n\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathfrak A_i/U\\models\\varphi[([\\bar f(j)]_U)_{j&lt;n}]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi[(\\bar f(j)(i))_{j&lt;n}]\\}\\in U\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定理4.1.9(ii)，印刷 pp.217–219（DjVu 233–235）的同一断言。仅把 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a> 的结构输出变量替换为唯一商结构项；没有另一个4.3.2b书中定理。证明核验范围继承该本地定理，本节点只核对记号替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-thm-los","status":"resolved","id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-los]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct-notation","status":"resolved","id":"3e71f70cb66ea186","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultraproduct-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-los","status":"resolved